{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】深圳下月舉行亞太經合組織APEC領導人非正式會議前，外交部宣布便利亞太區域商務人員往來措施。</p>\n<p>外交部宣布，將APEC商務旅行卡持有人在華最長停留時間，由原本的60天延長至90天，由周日起實施。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:23:46.310784+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:15:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:39:25.430269+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:19:24.691535+00:00","content_hash":"186fb0f1fd36c1ef5962263466db25b0f7840d3425f956920d2a804792fbbb73","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}